# Requiem for the Departed (crystalWar 23, call-only), the edges: a level 29 Warrior in the Eldieme Necropolis [S] with
# the Bronze Ribbon of Service (missions as the main flow). Level 29: Heptachiond's script 104. Fort Karugo-Narugo [S]:
# Pecca-Pocca available: 233. Accepted by a GM, the incense (a GM), the bag full (a GM): Heptachiond 107, finished: no
# room: not completed, the incense kept; 107 again.
lists TheEldiemeNecropolisS/Heptachiond/onTrigger FortKarugoNarugoS/Pecca-Pocca/onTrigger TheEldiemeNecropolisS/onEventFinish/107
char zone=TheEldiemeNecropolisS pos=257.696,-31.999,20.073 job=WAR lvl=29
keyitem BronzeRibbonOfService
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
login
trigger Heptachiond                     # level 29: 104
finish
warp -161.478,-67.999,-155.099 FortKarugoNarugoS
trigger Pecca-Pocca                     # available: 233
finish
quest CrystalWar.RequiemForTheDeparted accepted # a GM
keyitem SheafOfHandmadeIncense          # a GM
fill-inventory                          # a GM: no slot free
warp 257.696,-31.999,20.073 TheEldiemeNecropolisS
trigger Heptachiond                     # the incense: 107
finish                                  # no room: not completed; the incense kept
trigger Heptachiond                     # still accepted: 107
finish
